    ✔ PROVEN, not just asserted: examples/minimal is a second game on engine/ alone @project(Roadmap (future / bigger efforts))
    ✔ ENFORCED by scripts, not discipline (tests/run-tests.sh runs all of these): @project(Roadmap (future / bigger efforts))
      audit-boundary.sh      no engine/ file may name a game/ symbol; also checks
      every hook the engine CALLS is DEFINED by both games
      audit-shadow.sh        no local named after a high-risk shared global
      audit-shortcircuit.sh  no bounds guard relying on short-circuit (QB64 has none)
      6 unit suites          200 assertions over the game-free engine modules
